# Normalise line endings in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# This is not cosmetic for this project. The launchers are piped into sh/bash,
# where a stray carriage return breaks them -- the classic "curl | bash" CRLF
# failure -- and the report golden file is compared byte for byte. A contributor
# on Windows with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise break both.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows PowerShell reads LF scripts without complaint, so everything text is
# LF and the repository has exactly one line-ending convention.

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
